# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values for local development.
# .env* files are gitignored at the repo root — never commit real secrets here.

# Web3Forms access key used by the contact form (src/components/sections/Contact.tsx).
# Get your own key at https://web3forms.com, or ask the project owner for the
# production key. It must also be set in the hosting platform's environment
# variable config, and should be domain-restricted in the Web3Forms dashboard to
# https://sravankumar.online (manual, non-code step).
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-web3forms-access-key-here
